    "detailed_description": "Half of the people who have played this game have given up,<br />\r\nanother half of the remaining people are angry,<br />\r\nanother half are disappointed,<br />\r\nand the last remaining people are lovable freaks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo those friends I send this game, and I hope you are one of them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbClick and drag to bounce the head and tail up and forward.<br />\r\n\u30fbVarious narrations &amp; BGMare played as the event progresses.<br />\r\n\u30fbYou can look back at the photos and videos you have collected.<br />\r\n\u30fbThere is an auto-save function.<br />\r\n\u30fbIt is compatible with the joystick of the game pad (the one with two joysticks).<br />\r\n\u30fbYou can distribute the entire game, including play screens and clear bonuses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse simple controls to control\u300emoci\u300fand reach the summit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClimbing is the accumulation of the past, it is like life.<br />\r\nHere is a future waiting to be built up for you and a life of moci.<br />\r\nCome join us in reaching the summit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game could not have been created by me alone.<br />\r\nMy utmost respect to the great pioneers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;SE.BGM&quot;<br />\r\n\u30fbIwashiro Sounds works<br />\r\n\u30fbMusMus<br />\r\n\u30fbmusic by audionautix<br />\r\n\u30fbOtoLogic<br />\r\n\u30fbThumbwash",
